        <mxCell id="v-ac7e87f4e1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Safety:&lt;/b&gt; keep a real hardware E-stop / power disconnect. Place a normally-closed E-stop or interlock contact in series with the X4-11 energise sink so a Pico reset cannot enable the drive. Do not interrupt U/V/W while powered." vertex="1">
